  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assistance to develop a proposal for new building codes and standards concerning thermal insulation and energy conservation in new buildings. Latvian part is Ministry of Environmental Protection and Regional Development. Swedish part is Svensk Byggledning AB.</narrative>
